{
 "about": [
  "Whether an MCP tool call reads or changes something, by the tool's name.",
  "servers: the most used SaaS servers' tools, matched on the server's name (a pattern, any case) and the tool's exact name (any case). GitHub's lists come from the server's own annotations (readOnlyHint), refreshed by build_rules.py; the others are this project's own, from each server's tool documentation (in the row's source), checked October 2026.",
  "sql: tools that run the SQL they are given; a change when it holds a writing statement (INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE, CREATE, ALTER, DROP…), else a read.",
  "verbs: any other tool, of any server, by the first of these words in its name (save_issue, editJiraIssue, notion-create-pages). A word in defer (execute, run) takes the next word's meaning when that is a verb here (execute_read_query, executeWrite). A tool with none of these words is left unclassified: counted as a call only."
 ],
